    "regime_notes": "Validated across the full synthetic cross-asset history using all available tradable instruments and at least 8 valid names per date. Full-sample daily IC and daily ICIR clear the benchmark admission gates; recent 365-day and 730-day ICIR are below the gate, while the recent 1095-day window remains above it. Interpret uncertainty conservatively given the approximately 11-name average cross-section.",
    "signal_artifact": "scripts/artifacts/miner_1_20330331_volatility_gated_range_reversal_signal.csv",
